  "title": "Blood Bunnies",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Enter a hauntingly whimsical world where innocence wears a cracked mask and ancient traditions spiral into absurd, beautiful chaos. Blood Bunnies is a cinematic audio drama with the heart of a tragedy, the wit of dark comedy, and the unsettling grace of arthouse horror. Its richly woven musical tapestry—full of haunting melodies and evocative motifs—elevates every gasp and lingering silence. Strange, seductive, and wholly original, this is a story that will haunt your imagination long after the final echo fades.",
